The stylesheets under inst/basecoat are built from the sources in srcss by
`just vendor`, and carry code from two MIT licensed projects:

  Files: inst/basecoat/*.css
  Sources: basecoat-css, https://github.com/hunvreus/basecoat
             Copyright (c) 2025 Ronan Berder
           Tailwind CSS, https://github.com/tailwindlabs/tailwindcss
             Copyright (c) Tailwind Labs, Inc.
  License: MIT. The basecoat-css terms are reproduced in
           inst/basecoat/LICENSE.md.

The scripts are copied from basecoat-css unchanged:

  Files: inst/basecoat/js/*.js
  Source: https://github.com/hunvreus/basecoat (npm: basecoat-css)
  Copyright (c) 2025 Ronan Berder
  License: MIT, reproduced in inst/basecoat/LICENSE.md
